        (Real.1 / two) * (Real.1 + -(x.sin * pointwise_neg(Real.sin, x) + x.cos * x.cos)) =
            (Real.1 / two) * (Real.1 + -(x.sin * -x.sin + x.cos * x.cos))
        x.sin * -x.sin = -(x.sin * x.sin)
        (Real.1 / two) * (Real.1 + -(x.sin * -x.sin + x.cos * x.cos)) =
